ral Hospital  They have not been cleared or approved by the U S  Food and Drug Administration  FDA   The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary  this laboratory has established and verified the test s accuracy and precision  Added by  Atul Kumar Bhan  M D  Signed On  23 REMOVED_MONTH 03 at 16 28 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left lumpectomy tissue   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 5cm portion of tan pink lobulated fibrofatty tissue with a short stitch designating the anterior  a long stitch designating the lateral  and a bow tie designating the superior margins  Along the anterior aspect  there is a REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm tan white unremarkable skin ellipse  The anterior aspect is inked blue  the posterior black  the superior green  and the inferior yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned from medial to lateral to reveal two irregular  ill defined discontinuous lesions  The smaller lesion measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm and is located 1 0cm from the posterior inferior  2 0cm from the superior  and 2 0cm from the anterior  2 1cm from the medial  and 1 5cm from the lateral aspects  The larger mass is located 0 5cm anterior to the smaller mass and measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm  The larger anterior mass is located  0 1cm from the anterior aspect  1 0cm from the inferior  2 0cm from the posterior  0 9cm from the superior  2 5cm from the medial  and 1 4cm from the lateral soft tissue margins respectively  The parenchyma between the two masses is tan white to yellow  rubbery  and nodular  The remaining uninvolved parenchyma is tan yellow to pink  and unremarkable  Representative sections are submitted as follows  A B  Smaller lesion to posterior black inked margin  entirely submitted   C  Nodular fibrotic area in between the two discontinuous masses  D  Larger mass to overlying skin  E F  Larger mass to closest superior margin  G  Larger mass 