Accession Number   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Report Status  FinalType  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  OPERATION DATE  12 REMOVED_MONTH 01 ACCESSIONED ON  12 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 12 40 CLINICAL DATA  Patient has a fibroadenoma which has increased in size                                                                                      FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  CELLULAR STROMAL PROLIFERATION CONSISTENT WITH PSEUDOANGIOMATOUS STROMAL HYPERPLASIA  SEE NOTE  NOTE  The lesion consists of a proliferation of the non specialized interlobular stroma with secondary distortion of pre existing lobules  Focal areas more typical of pseudoangiomatous stromal hyperplasia merge with this cellular proliferation  Immunostains for  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  strongly stain the intralobular stroma with less prominent staining of the interlobular stroma  The latter also shows focal positivity for progesterone receptor and is largely negative for estrogen receptor  Overall  these features are most consistent with a diagnosis of pseudoangiomatous stromal hyperplasia  Dr  F  Koerner has reviewed the case and concurs with the diagnosis  Diagnosis by  MELINDA J  FAN  MD Signed On  02 REMOVED_MONTH 01 at 11 23                                                                                 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast nodule  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4 0cm tan white  well circumscribed  lobulated  rubbery to slightly firm mass which is black inked and serially sectioned to reveal a segmented tan pink homogeneous soft surface  Representative sections are submitted in A E and G Z  Also received in the same container is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm portion of tan white fibrous soft tissue fragments which are black inked  serially sectioned and representative sections are submitted as F  Gross Description by  LORI MARINI Resident  ANUPAMA GUPTA  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY , Negative.
